        "original_id": "e256b271-416b-5fb5-9fcc-6e06f878b0ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Jaffa Road, Jerusalem Central Bus Station\n- Landmarks: Tzahal Square, Safra Square, Zion Square, Davidka Square, Hameshulash, Ben Yehuda Street pedestrian mall, Mahane Yehuda market\n- Companies: Egged, Superbus, Dan\n- Roads/Streets: King George V Street, Straus Street\n\nFacts:\n- Jaffa Road includes major landmarks such as Tzahal Square, Safra Square, Zion Square, Davidka Square, Hameshulash, the Ben Yehuda Street pedestrian mall, the Mahane Yehuda market, and the Jerusalem Central Bus Station.\n- Hameshulash is the \"Triple\" intersection of King George V Street and Straus Street on Jaffa Road.\n- Jerusalem Central Bus Station is located on Jaffa Road near the entrance to the city.\n- Jerusalem Central Bus Station serves intercity bus routes operated by Egged, Superbus, and Dan.",
